# Machine-built language files. `php cdn translate` writes them, and so does the
# switcher when somebody picks a language nobody has read the site in yet - they
# are built on the machine that serves them, per installation, rather than
# carried in the repository. English and Turkish are written by hand and stay.
.syncftp
